    "summary": "This project builds upon the foundation of the [browser-use](https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use), which is designed to make websites accessible for AI agents. We would like to officially thank [WarmShao](https://github.com/warmshao) for his contribution to this project. **WebUI:** is built on Gradio and supports most of `browser-use` functionalities. This UI is designed to be user-friendly and enables easy interaction with the browser agent. **Expanded LLM Support:** We've integrated support for various Large Language Models (LLMs), including: Go"
